  - type: generic
    title: A Machine Learning Approach to Foreign Key Discovery
    authors:
      - family-names: Rostin
        given-names: A.
      - name: et al.
    year: 2009
    notes: >-
      The heuristic features over inclusion dependencies reverse/population.py
