  - type: conference-paper
    title: On Multi-Column Foreign Key Discovery
    authors:
      - family-names: Zhang
        given-names: M.
      - name: et al.
    conference:
      name: VLDB 2010
    year: 2010
    notes: >-
      The value-distribution ("randomness") test reverse/population.py
      implements.
  - type: generic
    title: Feature importances for foreign-key detection
    authors:
      - family-names: Motl
      - family-names: Kordík
    notes: >-
      Title not recorded; described by its finding. Global assignment worth as
